Third-party integration credits
===============================

The TechnoStore demo integrates with the following third-party services. Their
trademarks and APIs are property of their respective owners. This project uses
them under their standard developer / sandbox terms of service:

- SAP (SAP SE) — S/4HANA Cloud APIs, Event Mesh (CloudEvents)
- lexoffice / Lexware Office (Haufe-Lexware GmbH) — SME cloud accounting
- DATEV (DATEV eG) — Steuerberater accounting (Buchungsstapel CSV format)
- Stripe (Stripe Inc.) — payment processing
- Sendcloud (SendCloud B.V.) — parcel logistics
- DHL (Deutsche Post DHL Group) — carrier integration via Sendcloud
- DocuSign (Docusign, Inc.) — e-signature
- Slack (Slack Technologies, LLC / Salesforce) — team notifications
- Atlassian Jira (Atlassian Corporation Plc) — ticket tracking
- Notion (Notion Labs, Inc.) — portfolio documentation
- MuleSoft Anypoint Platform (Salesforce, Inc.) — integration orchestration

All integration credentials in this repository are placeholders or are stored
in gitignored configuration files (Custom Settings, mule-app.properties). No
production credentials are committed.
